<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Profile on ByF (BaiFan) · Daily Deep Think</title><link>https://blog.baifan.site/en/tags/profile/</link><description>Recent content in Profile on ByF (BaiFan) · Daily Deep Think</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><managingEditor>blog@baifan.site (ByF (BaiFan))</managingEditor><webMaster>blog@baifan.site (ByF (BaiFan))</webMaster><copyright>CC BY-NC 4.0</copyright><lastBuildDate>Tue, 29 Sep 2026 15:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://blog.baifan.site/en/tags/profile/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>About Me</title><link>https://blog.baifan.site/en/profile/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><author>blog@baifan.site (ByF (BaiFan))</author><guid>https://blog.baifan.site/en/profile/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology and business in the AI age, taken apart on the timescale of geology.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h2 class="relative group"&gt;What I Write&#10; &lt;div id="what-i-write" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&#10; class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#what-i-write" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;This blog focuses on rigorous deep thinking and software engineering, rejecting buzzword inflation and surface-level summaries:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h3 class="relative group"&gt;1. AI Fundamentals &amp;amp; System Implementation&#10; &lt;div id="1-ai-fundamentals--system-implementation" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&#10; class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#1-ai-fundamentals--system-implementation" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.baifan.site/en/rag-system-complete-guide-langchain-ollama-pgvector/" &gt;Complete Guide to RAG Systems&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: Building a production-grade local Retrieval-Augmented Generation system with LangChain, Ollama, and pgvector.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.baifan.site/en/ai-technical-glossary-complete-guide/" &gt;Glossary of 270+ AI Terms&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: Systematic taxonomy spanning tokens, embeddings, Transformers, and prompt engineering.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.baifan.site/en/gpu-accelerated-training-cuda-complete-guide/" &gt;GPU Accelerated Training &amp;amp; CUDA&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: Memory allocation patterns, hardware accelerators, and parallel training topologies.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h3 class="relative group"&gt;2. AI Agent Architecture &amp;amp; Source Dives&#10; &lt;div id="2-ai-agent-architecture--source-dives" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&#10; class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#2-ai-agent-architecture--source-dives" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.baifan.site/en/claude-code-think-act-observe-loop/" &gt;Claude Code Source Dive: The Think-Act-Observe Loop&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: Deconstructing industrial Agent design — how a single closed loop powers complex tool use and reflection.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.baifan.site/en/claude-code-memory-system/" &gt;Agent Memory Architectures&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: Workspace context persistence, session compaction, and progressive disclosure protocols.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.baifan.site/en/multi-agent-collaboration-engineering/" &gt;Multi-Agent Engineering&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: Dynamic intervention, runtime boundaries, and agentic orchestration.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h3 class="relative group"&gt;3. Current Affairs &amp;amp; Global Economics&#10; &lt;div id="3-current-affairs--global-economics" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&#10; class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#3-current-affairs--global-economics" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.baifan.site/en/tags/economist/" &gt;The Economist Readings&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: Structural analysis of geopolitics, semiconductor sovereignty, and macro trends.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.baifan.site/en/china-county-economy-twilight/" &gt;Twilight of the County Town&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: Micro-level investigation of industrial relocation, real estate, and social shifts.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h3 class="relative group"&gt;4. Engineering Practice&#10; &lt;div id="4-engineering-practice" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&#10; class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#4-engineering-practice" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;ul&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.baifan.site/en/tmux-practical-guide/" &gt;Tmux Practical Guide&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: The essential command set for persistent terminal multiplexing and splits.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.baifan.site/en/distributed-system-heartbeat-mechanism/" &gt;Distributed Heartbeat Systems&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: Failure detection, leases, and partition tolerance.&lt;/li&gt;&#10;&lt;/ul&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&#10;&lt;h2 class="relative group"&gt;About ByF&#10; &lt;div id="about-byf" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#10; &#10; &lt;span&#10; class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;&#10; &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#about-byf" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10; &lt;/span&gt;&#10; &#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ByF&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;BaiFan (白帆)&lt;/strong&gt; are two spellings of the same name. Backend &amp;amp; AI systems engineer, author of the &lt;a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/@byfriends/cli" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"&gt;byf terminal AI coding agent&lt;/a&gt; and the &lt;a href="https://github.com/ByronFinn/dev-skills" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"&gt;dev-skills engineering skill set&lt;/a&gt;. The canonical home of this digital identity is &lt;a href="https://baifan.site" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"&gt;baifan.site&lt;/a&gt;; technical writing lives at &lt;a href="https://blog.baifan.site" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"&gt;blog.baifan.site&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>